    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>&lt;section class=\"secret\"&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;p&gt;Raise Dead is a classic spell, but even in this version with a built-in chance to fail, it still makes bringing a PC back from the dead much easier than with the severely limited Resurrection spell in the Core Book. It depends on the intended grittiness of the campaign whether GMs want to make Raise Dead available as a spell or not.&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/section&gt;</p>"
